*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0032
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-01-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 512
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0032.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0032C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 CREDIT-DECLINED VALUE 'D'.
        88 CREDIT-REFERRED VALUE 'R'.
    05 DECN-REASON        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM BANKRUPTCY-CHECK
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    DISPLAY "DECN-REASON=" DECN-REASON
    STOP RUN.
BANKRUPTCY-CHECK.
    IF PRIOR-BK-FLG = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> RECENT BANKRUPTCY DECLINE
            WHEN YRS-SINCE-BK LESS THAN 10
                SET CREDIT-DECLINED TO TRUE
                MOVE 'BK1' TO DECN-REASON
            WHEN OTHER
                SET CREDIT-REFERRED TO TRUE
                MOVE 'BK2' TO DECN-REASON
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'NA' TO DECN-REASON
    END-IF.
